Qualcomm Dragonwing platforms will power tens of thousands of starlink mobile 5G base stations starting in 2027. This is SpaceX Daily Episode 152. Norway's defense contract, orbital compute, and xai's new sites come next. Then the counterpoint and an engineering deep dive. SpaceX selects Qualcomm's QRU 100 radio units and QDU 100 baseband units along with layer 1 software. Tesla Roddy reports to drive massive,

